flowchart TD

    A([Start])

    A --> B{WiFi Connected?}

    B -->|No| Z([Return])

    B -->|Yes| C[Create HTTPClient]

    C --> D[Begin HTTP Session]
    D --> E[Add JSON Content-Type Header]

    E --> F[Initialize Payload ]
    F --> G[Set first = true]
    G --> H[Initialize Loop i = 0]

    H --> I{i < 14?}

    I -->|No| J[Close JSON Array]

    I -->|Yes| K{Temperature > -100?}

    K -->|No| L[Increment i]

    K -->|Yes| M{First Entry?}

    M -->|No| N[Append Comma]
    M -->|Yes| O[Append JSON Object]

    N --> O

    O --> P[Set first = false]

    P --> L

    L --> I

    J --> Q[Print POST URL and Payload]

    Q --> R[HTTP POST Payload]

    R --> S{HTTP Code > 0?}

    S -->|No| T[Print POST Failed]

    S -->|Yes| U[Print HTTP Return Code]

    U --> V{HTTP Code 200 or 201?}

    V -->|Yes| W[Print Success Message]

    V -->|No| X[Continue]

    W --> X
    T --> X

    X --> Y[End HTTP Session]

    Y --> Z
